      "label": "Evaluator (Pure Function)\n`decide(request, policy, session) → Decision`\n\nOrder:\n1. Validate request → DENY if malformed\n2. Normalize (paths/hosts/argv)\n3. Classify tool (read/write/exec/network/memory/unknown)\n4. Invariants (compiled-in, DENY only)\n5. Flow rules (taint-based)\n6. Rules: deny > approval > allow > default\n7. Mode: audit converts DENY→ALLOW + would_block",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Evaluator (Pure Function)\n`decide(request, policy, session) → Decision`\n\nOrder:\n1. Validate request → DENY if malformed\n2. Normalize (paths/hosts/argv)\n3. Classify tool (read/write/exec/network/memory/unknown)\n4. Invariants (compiled-in, DENY only)\n5. Flow rules (taint-based)\n6. Rules: deny > approval > allow > default\n7. Mode: audit converts DENY→ALLOW + would_block",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
